SUMMARY:Music for Safe Homes: A Benefit for RESPOND
LOCATION:Crystal Ballroom\, 55 Davis Square\, Somerville\, MA 02144
DESCRIPTION:Music for safe homes\, a concert to benefit Respond\, Inc. It's
  been a bit\, but The Ames Curve is back. Grab a supportive pair of shoes 
 and come join us for a special night of music also featuring Alexayndria..
 .Go!\, and The Rockery. Come support local art and win prizes from local b
 usinesses. The best part? All proceeds will be donated directly to RESPOND
 \, Inc. RESPOND\, Inc.\, based here in Somerville\, is New Englands first 
 domestic violence agency\, dedicated to partnering with individuals\, fami
 lies\, and communities to end the serious public health issue of domestic 
 violence through prevention\, intervention\, and direct services. Come out
 \, enjoy good music\, and help provide life-saving shelter to survivors of
  domestic abuse. Secure your tickets now and be part of this impactful eve
 nt.\nhttps://www.ticketmaster.com/music-for-safe-homes-a-benefit-somervill
 e-massachusetts-10-09-2026/event/01006513AE492312\nFrom Pushpin Boston: ht
 tps://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://www.ticketmaster.com/music-for-safe-homes-a-benefit-somerville-
 massachusetts-10-09-2026/event/01006513AE492312
END:VEVENT
